XR loader to the core of Godot.\r\n\r\nThis means that as long as the headset supports it, and you don't use any vendor features or have features locked behind vendor specific manifest entries, Godot can export to a headset without needing the vendor plugin.\r\n\r\nAll you need to do is enabled `Use Gradle Build`:\r\n<img width=\"701\" height=\"219\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/44f322d7-578d-441e-8741-a3e7191e7176\" />\r\n\r\nAnd set the `XR Mode` to `OpenXR`:\r\n<img width=\"706\" height=\"268\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5f2cbe77-f9a5-4022-80b2-3994902eed7d\" />\r\n\r\nAnd your game can be successfully exported to AOSP devices.\r\n\r\nTested on:\r\n- Quest 3\r\n- Pico 4 Ultra\r\n\r\n*Contributed by Khronos Group through the Godot Integration Project*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use